      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1360261701,
      "text": "Rhizophora stylosa, the spotted mangrove, red mangrove, small stilted mangrove or stilt-root mangrove, is a small to medium-sized evergreen tree in the family Rhizophoraceae. The specific epithet stylosa is from the Latin meaning 'stylus form', referring to the flower."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Bakau kecil",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bakau_kecil",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 28498511,
      "text": "Rhizophora stylosa, bakau totol, bakau merah, bakau kecil atau bakau akar jangkungan, merupakan sejenis pohon bakau dalam famili Rhizophoraceae"
    }
